  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db4bfa3439781c44daaf1680eead8522, type: 2}
    text: 'As it happens. There is a boar out on the grass north of the road, east of the camp, which is wrong all by itself, and we could use the meat. Take my spare bow: hold the left button to draw, let go to shoot. Bring it down.'
    acceptText: I'll hunt it.
    waitingText: The boar, on the grass north of the road, east of the camp. Hold the left button to draw.
    askText: Anything I can help with?
    thanksText: Clean enough. Keep the bow; you've earned it, and I was tired of carrying it.
  speakerName: Runa
