          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Rumours grow in the telling. That is why we go and look, instead of sitting in a longhouse and listening.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533503959
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 57af53ce415948be96b95df0042798f4
        position: {x: 640, y: 1080}
        reaches: 0.85
    - rid: 2623126109533503960
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 854be6764311442099f91fed79780eef
        position: {x: 940, y: 910}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Is it past noon already? We have not been walking an hour.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533503961
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 2f46c01eebed4c1e84feb7c29f76d682
        position: {x: 940, y: 1080}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Hold up. That's Bjarne's handcart, tipped off the road. Have a look; I'll watch the trees.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533503962
      type: {class: WaitForEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 077e462298d94099bd0c638efad421f0
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1822e4f3d74228b489493e550b28c6ca, type: 2}
        orAfterSeconds: 25
    - rid: 2623126109533503963
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9fd0e57c0caf43c18d098e46a72dc66f
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Horses, running flat out, and not from us. Off the road!
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533503964
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 662de01ed4954cff93dbe449c1f63a04
        position: {x: 1540, y: 230}
        seconds: 5
    - rid: 2623126109533503965
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 66d356f2c5454fdaa779085cf2b0a0b8
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Wolves behind them! In the open, in daylight. They don't do that. Weapons!
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533503966
      type: {class: SpawnEnemiesNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 342d46a824514dfb934da5893f087a78
        position: {x: 1840, y: 230}
        zone: {fileID: 920839411}
        waitUntilDefeated: 1
        orAfterSeconds: 300
    - rid: 2623126109533503967
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 6311550e2f184cde96d3d35e9b4f6ff9
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Wolves that hunt by day and do not fear four armed people. Whatever happened to this cart was quick, and it did not end here. We go on.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533503968
