        alsoAfterLoading: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533504256
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c75b280033084953b773d6c6d53a3e24
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 367a938ebe0a9f847806fbc01218a5e2, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504257
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 572a900ce4c34cd2af982048fa2110ae
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        seconds: 0.4
    - rid: 2623126109533504258
      type: {class: PlayCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 673ad2301c1b460898b959b429e3f91f
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1826988864}
        waitUntilFinished: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504259
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: dc1d1f036239446b825eb1d02d79fb92
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: 'For anyone who slept through last night''s talk, and I know who you are: I am Sigrid, and we walk east today. The villages asked what is wrong in that forest. Two days ago I sent Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor and Liv ahead to look. They should have been back yesterday.'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504260
      type: {class: CueCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 168c839cef4a40adb5590138936933c5
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1826988864}
        shot: 2
    - rid: 2623126109533504261
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5c84076fce014204a9aad2261cbb13bf
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Eirik. Twenty winters in the shield wall at Granheim. I walk in front, I carry the heavy things and I make sure everyone eats. There is porridge. It is bad.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504262
      type: {class: CueCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 69a9801c86844d029b4c80b13c4d219d
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1826988864}
        shot: 3
    - rid: 2623126109533504263
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 297f5eef6e8549ca9d2131c85887f189
        position: {x: 2440, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Runa. I find the tracks, and I shoot what makes them. Trolls off their crags, witches on the roads, wolves that don't run from fire. I want to see it for myself before I believe any of it.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504264
      type: {class: CueCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5d072b2af1ab40bda3bd70dbd80ed2c3
        position: {x: 2740, y: 60}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1826988864}
        shot: 4
    - rid: 2623126109533504265
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: d29ae1df9b8c4b6ab5171f86ff9c5046
        position: {x: 3040, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: And you. You came to us with a strong back and few questions. Nobody walks towards that forest by accident. Why are you here?
        answers:
        - For the coin.
        - Someone I know went in there.
        - To see if the stories are true.
        mustAnswer: 1
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533504266
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: e65aace903d043dd9a450f687d761d15
        position: {x: 3340, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 052e1548b0a161348bb7cf591b4333f7, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504267
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8c41940d7b744639b5c5e110236868a4
        position: {x: 3340, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1a0301acf429304ba7ad3d189da48bb, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504268
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 72cc08d3d51c4beda3096f855692ddbe
        position: {x: 3340, y: 400}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1426971087cd5fb408c55293cb5e4e12, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504269
      type: {class: CueCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: e5624a5409994c018805d6b90f9588ca
        position: {x: 3640, y: 60}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1826988864}
        shot: 3
    - rid: 2623126109533504270
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 859f6f579780419db8c753f340c08147
        position: {x: 3940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: An honest answer. I like you already.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504271
      type: {class: CueCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 055078e19ec946ea913c6f06748e66c6
        position: {x: 3640, y: 230}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1826988864}
        shot: 2
    - rid: 2623126109533504272
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4d123566e04b4dd981e7936b83bfe7d0
        position: {x: 3940, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Then we are after the same thing. We will find them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504273
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 68b4dcc4395a4bcaabc7f683393d8115
        position: {x: 3640, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Careful. The ones who go looking for the truth of it are the ones who find it.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504274
      type: {class: CueCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 112e0c4303ae4314bf37e4381a3cd863
        position: {x: 4240, y: 60}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1826988864}
        shot: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533504275
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 6078136874f546db9d4b3af49796f3d9
        position: {x: 4540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: We leave when you are ready. If you want to earn your porridge first, ask the others. They always have something.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504276
      type: {class: StopCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 990957174f394aad8228ff9d13ee9544
        position: {x: 4840, y: 60}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1826988864}
    - rid: 2623126109533504277
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: a700db508ba94e868ef279e7f5ed71cc
        position: {x: 4840, y: 230}
