  - from: 83506f73072f4b7ba13adf0d4b069be4
    output: 0
    to: 90a3e7e0373e4357a1635afbc6afadbc
  logSteps: 0
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 2623126109533504017
      type: {class: WhenQuestEvent, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c0b05366aad1459c9e681fe99b2ca401
        position: {x: 40, y: 60}
        once: 1
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7d3f1e76eaac0c4093ec068db341d61, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504018
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4b0c4dea8ae44e04acdd2d2878ff587c
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        seconds: 1.5
    - rid: 2623126109533504019
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: db433177278e420fb66c74873292b21a
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: 
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: <i>Sigrid lays her palm flat on the centre stone and holds it there. Nothing. The stone stays cold.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504020
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ad897268b11243bf9abc7b39f92011aa
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: It will not wake for me. It never has. You, then. Put your hand on the centre stone.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504021
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 2ded0d2ba2b34c3fb007bc17a27a09c4
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82ba4d914072adf478d4fa857f205026, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504022
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 300bc3044d2f45388045e6e8b22d08d2
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: You asked me by the fire, so here it is. I have seen stones like these wake once. It took everyone who stood too near, and it put them somewhere else. Ingrid knew that when she came. Now you do.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504023
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 398cc693274a47918fc2cf465094a1da
        position: {x: 1540, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Whatever you see, do not let go of the stone. There are things I should have told you, and there is no time left to tell them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504024
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 83506f73072f4b7ba13adf0d4b069be4
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 316e769a318ba5a44b33770cbaf45924, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504025
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 90a3e7e0373e4357a1635afbc6afadbc
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: 
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: <i>The same marks as the stone by the lake, and the same warmth. It was already awake this morning.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
