    - rid: 2623126109533503988
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: b0a8815f745b4a08b9779b1d904a2998
        position: {x: 1240, y: 1080}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: That is no thunder. An old one, a mountain troll, and it is walking towards our fire.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533503989
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8e763a3219af42489edc788a5c65d7f5
        position: {x: 1540, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: It hasn't seen us yet. It will smell the smoke soon enough.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533503990
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 643bf808d57e45f3bed96fbb8e1d83de
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Leave the fire! Take the old path north, to the standing stones. Now!
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533503991
