        position: {x: 640, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Twenty years a soldier, and I have never seen the sun simply leave.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533504230
      type: {class: CueCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c8beda30fd5441999daa1db064010619
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1922524715}
        shot: 6
    - rid: 2623126109533504231
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5829abbd4bed43729086a0f92ceec198
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: That was no weather. The sun went down hours early and this storm came out of a clear sky. Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor and Liv walked into this two days ago, so we go on, not back. Follow the old road into the trees and find us dry shelter. We are right behind you.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533504232
      type: {class: StopCinematicNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9eae587a41c3472e8c78fae1e75ee3a6
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        cinematic: {fileID: 1922524715}
