        equip: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533504204
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 81d62d232d7544f5a9dd98c92ce44dc2
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A soldier's choice. It is old iron, but it holds an edge. Guard well and let them come to you.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504205
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 82f381d76c0b46c3a4a9f3bdf5c93913
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504206
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 613b61ad6b1942b7a98fe0c412366ae4
        position: {x: 1540, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: The axe. Good. It splits wolves and firewood alike, and it leaves you a hand free.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504207
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 27e04b102feb41c1b4c3e088ceaa58e1
        position: {x: 1840, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504208
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 87db2721a1744e87851bfdf7ea996629
        position: {x: 1540, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Long reach, and it wants both hands. If you ever need a light instead, press L to swap them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504209
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 090bf55caad4411c999c38dc45907fe5
        position: {x: 1840, y: 400}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504210
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 82d71a9c91c544b09b47af4eda4c5d7c
        position: {x: 1540, y: 570}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Simple. I respect that. Hit it until it stops, and it leaves you a hand free.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504211
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 517741bbf272428e804b646f75882d8b
        position: {x: 1840, y: 570}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504212
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: a2ceddc21210427aa3941c88c0ae0de0
        position: {x: 1540, y: 740}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: 'A bow! Then there are two of us. Hold the left button to draw, let go to shoot. It wants both hands: if you ever need a light instead, press L to swap them.'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504213
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
