    - rid: 2623126109533504051
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 20d2c025a3c845b4b9040c58e973c96f
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 37aaf30196600b248981ee89fdb7e2e2, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504052
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 848686cb64cf4fb1b45f3ec760b3acd0
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        seconds: 1.5
    - rid: 2623126109533504053
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: f66101615cfc42b4a5ba2c0e83d71370
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A fire. Sit down, all of you, and get your breath back. Whatever is out there will still be there when we are done.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504054
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 7e7756c0223e42de86fa3176bb949041
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: At first light we find the four who went ahead. Ingrid. Bjarne. Tor. And...
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504055
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ab1e0a3016f94d1b9391ae7fbdfe0bce
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: 
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: <i>She stops. Her lips move, and nothing comes.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504056
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 429fd956237e413c895a5fc57e23165c
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Liv.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504057
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: eaaf7db9d83e48258675d09ff4e4e904
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Liv. Of course. Eleven years I have known her, and for a moment there was a hole where her name should be.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126109533504058
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4cdde66983244b7ba6d316e54707fc95
        position: {x: 2440, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 37aaf30196600b248981ee89fdb7e2e2, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126109533504059
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 649a534ffa0e4aa790a4740440dfa82e
        position: {x: 2740, y: 60}
        seconds: 3
    - rid: 2623126109533504060
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 283e6f16cf554a0c83b0cc8929a633a2
        position: {x: 3040, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: It is this place. At the tree line I had to think for my own sister's name. I did not like to say.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126109533504061
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 6654e33c3bb94c398b4e9c75c60b2190
        position: {x: 3340, y: 60}
        seconds: 5
    - rid: 2623126109533504062
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 187c329477ad478f825675cf7109a2c8
        position: {x: 3640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: And there is only dry bread, unless someone fancies a walk. Ask me if you do.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
